WEBVTT

00:09:29.267 --> 00:09:31.415
what it means is you can take a cell,

00:09:31.415 --> 00:09:33.701
which is a pluripotent stem cell,

00:09:33.701 --> 00:09:36.385
which is like a skier at the top of a mountain,

00:09:36.385 --> 00:09:40.202
and those two skiers become two pluripotent stem cells,

00:09:40.202 --> 00:09:41.984
four, eight, 16,

00:09:41.984 --> 00:09:43.652
and then it gets so crowded

00:09:43.652 --> 00:09:45.452
after 16 divisions

00:09:45.452 --> 00:09:47.954
that those cells have to differentiate.

00:09:47.954 --> 00:09:49.387
So they go down one side of the mountain,

00:09:49.387 --> 00:09:50.620
they go down another.

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:52.154
And as they pick that,

00:09:52.154 --> 00:09:54.404
these become bone,

00:09:54.404 --> 00:09:57.336
and then they pick another road and these become platelets,

00:09:57.336 --> 00:09:59.453
and these become macrophages,

00:09:59.453 --> 00:10:00.720
and these become T cells.